      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to documented GET /v2/api-key/scope, matching the pinned credential validator. It does not list users and does not consume project/environment path segments.",
        "Host is fixed to documented api.permit.io. EU api.eu.permit.io and self-hosted PDP URLs are not accepted.",
        "Native category is dev-tools. GET omits Content-Type and the upstream user-agent. Returns raw Permit JSON under data."
